<title>RUSSIA: Nemtsov urges Russian power cos to raise capital.</title>
<headline>Nemtsov urges Russian power cos to raise capital.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian First Deputy Prime Minister Boris Nemtsov said on Tuesday that regional power utilities (energos) should raise capital by issuing new shares to fund restructuring.</p>
<p>He said the companies needed a way to attract investment funds.</p>
<p>&quot;I mean increasing authorised capital of the regional companies,&quot; he told a news conference. &quot;It needs to be done quickly.&quot;</p>
</text>
